   "widgets_values": [
    "**Image to video**\n\n1. In **Load Image**, pick your still (for example a Midjourney image).\n2. In **prompt**, describe the motion and camera, not what is already in the image.\n3. Press **Run**. With **ratio** on \"auto\" the clip follows the shape of your still.\n\nFirst time? Open the template **1 Save your HashBidX key** and run it once."
   ],
